        <kbr:kodeATC>J01MA02</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>J01MA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>BebasMakan_JedaSusu</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>CONTRAINDICATIONS A history of hypersensitivity to ciprofloxacin or any other component of the medication is a contraindication to its use. A history of hypersensitivity to other quinolones may also contraindicate the use of ciprofloxacin.</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>1500 mg/hari</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>Sesuai resep dokter (harus habis)</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Susu, yogurt, suplemen kalsium/zat besi/zinc dalam 2 jam; kafein berlebih</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Levofloxacin; Ofloxacin; Moxifloxacin (seluruh kelas kuinolon)</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>ANTIBIOTIK RESEP. Wajib dihabiskan sesuai durasi resep dokter.</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
        <kbr:urlSumberAlergi>https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=05b2836d-cd3d-4d7f-970c-66ec2d788667</kbr:urlSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>ResepDokter</kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:waktuMinumTeks>Bebas makan; beri jeda 2 jam sebelum atau 4-6 jam sesudah susu/antasida/mineral</kbr:waktuMinumTeks>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


