        <kbr:aksiBawahBatas>Obat keras / resep dokter</kbr:aksiBawahBatas>
        <kbr:bbMinSwamedikasi>ResepDokter</kbr:bbMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:chebiID>CHEBI:3380</kbr:chebiID>
        <kbr:dosisAnak>Sesuai resep dokter</kbr:dosisAnak>
        <kbr:dosisDewasa>12.5-50 mg 2-3 kali sehari</kbr:dosisDewasa>
        <kbr:dosisMgPerKg>Dosis titrasi resep dokter</kbr:dosisMgPerKg>
        <kbr:frekuensiMinum>2-3 kali sehari</kbr:frekuensiMinum>
        <kbr:gejalaAlergi>Angioedema wajah/lidah/tenggorokan (mengancam napas!), ruam, batuk kering</kbr:gejalaAlergi>
        <kbr:golonganAlergen>ACE Inhibitor</kbr:golonganAlergen>
        <kbr:kodeATC>C09AA01</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>C09AA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>SebelumMakan</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>CONTRAINDICATIONS Captopril tablets are contraindicated in patients who are hypersensitive to this product or any other angiotensin- converting enzyme inhibitor (e.g., a patient who has experienced angioedema during therapy with any other ACE inhibitor). WARNINGS Anaphylactoid and Possibly Related Reactions Presumably because angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitors affect the metabolism of eicosanoids and polypeptid</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>150 mg/hari (hipertensi)</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>Obat rutin (sesuai resep dokter)</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Makanan/suplemen tinggi kalium (pisang/garam rendah Na berlebih); makanan saat minum obat</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Enalapril; Lisinopril; Ramipril (seluruh kelas ACE inhibitor — riwayat angioedema kontraindikasi mutlak)</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>OBAT RESEP RUTIN. Efek samping khas: batuk kering menetap (bradikinin).</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
        <kbr:urlSumberAlergi>https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=1395ba5b-2fc9-41ff-9c43-e0740d781dee</kbr:urlSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>ResepDokter</kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:waktuMinumTeks>Saat perut kosong: 1 jam sebelum makan</kbr:waktuMinumTeks>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


