        <kbr:bbMinSwamedikasi>20</kbr:bbMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:chebiID>CHEBI:50346</kbr:chebiID>
        <kbr:dosisAnak>6-12 th: 30 mg tiap 4-6 jam</kbr:dosisAnak>
        <kbr:dosisDewasa>60 mg tiap 4-6 jam (atau 120 mg SR tiap 12 jam)</kbr:dosisDewasa>
        <kbr:dosisMgPerKg>Berbasis umur (non-mg/kg)</kbr:dosisMgPerKg>
        <kbr:frekuensiMinum>3-4 kali sehari (pagi &amp; siang)</kbr:frekuensiMinum>
        <kbr:gejalaAlergi>Ruam alergi, gatal, bengkak wajah</kbr:gejalaAlergi>
        <kbr:golonganAlergen>Dekongestan Simpatomimetik</kbr:golonganAlergen>
        <kbr:kodeATC>R01BA02</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>R01BA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>BebasMakan_HindariMalam</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>Do not use if you are now taking a prescription monoamine oxidase inhibitor (MAOI) (certain drugs for depression, psychiatric or emotional conditions, or Parkinson&apos;s disease), or for 2 weeks after stopping the MAOI drug. If you do not know if your prescription drug contains an MAOI, ask a doctor or pharmacist before taking this product.</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>240 mg/hari</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>3-5 hari</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Kafein/kopi/minuman berenergi berlebih (palpitasi &amp; tekanan darah)</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Efedrin / Fenilefrin / Fenilpropanolamin (amina simpatomimetik)</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>Dapat memicu jantung berdebar, naik tekanan darah, dan sulit tidur.</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
