    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AA">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#KelasTerapiATC4"/>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>R06AA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Aminoalkyl ethers</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AB -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AB">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#KelasTerapiATC4"/>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>R06AB</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Substituted alkylamines</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AE -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AE">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#KelasTerapiATC4"/>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>R06AE</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Piperazine derivatives</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AX -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#atc4_R06AX">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#KelasTerapiATC4"/>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>R06AX</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Other antihistamines for systemic use</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT001_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT001_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Database interaksi terkurasi + regulator resmi (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Inhibisi kuat enzim CYP3A4 oleh Itraconazole menyebabkan akumulasi kadar Simvastatin hingga 10-15x lipat.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>http://ddinter.scbdd.com</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code A) &amp; PIONAS BPOM RI</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT002_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT002_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Regulator klinis + database interaksi (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Inhibisi metabolisme hepatik CYP3A4 meningkatkan bioavailabilitas dan konsentrasi plasma atorvastatin.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code D) &amp; FDA Drug Safety Communication</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT003_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT003_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Uji preklinis &amp; mikrosom hati manusia (bukan uji klinis pasien) (Tingkat bukti kurasi: B (Uji Preklinis &amp; Model Mikrosom)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Senyawa xanthone (Alpha-mangostin) menghambat enzim CYP3A4 secara in vitro dan in vivo pada mikrosom hati manusia.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.phymed.2011.01.010</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Phytomedicine 2011; Drug Metab Dispos 2014</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT004_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT004_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Uji preklinis inhibisi CYP3A4 (Tingkat bukti kurasi: B (Uji Preklinis)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Inhibisi enzim CYP3A4 oleh ekstrak manggis menghambat metabolisme lintas pertama amlodipine.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.phymed.2011.01.010</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Biochemical Pharmacology &amp; Herb-Drug Interaction Studies</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT005_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT005_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Regulator klinis &amp; farmakokinetik terbukti (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Omeprazole secara kompetitif menghambat CYP2C19, enzim yang esensial untuk mengubah prodrug clopidogrel menjadi metabolit aktifnya.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 &amp; FDA Boxed Warning Clopidogrel-Omeprazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT006_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT006_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Database interaksi &amp; pedoman regulator (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Inhibisi COX-1 oleh Ibuprofen merusak fungsi agregasi platelet dan mukosa lambung, bersinergi dengan efek antikoagulan Warfarin.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://pionas.pom.go.id</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code B) &amp; PIONAS BPOM Antikoagulan</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT007_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT007_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Laporan kasus &amp; mekanisme antiplatelet aditif (Tingkat bukti kurasi: B (Laporan Kasus &amp; Farmakologis)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Senyawa gingerol menghambat sintesis tromboksan dan agregasi platelet secara aditif dengan warfarin.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://doi.org/10.1124/dmd.108.022988</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Natural Medicines &amp; J. Clin. Pharm. Ther.</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT008_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT008_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Bukti farmakologis dosis suplemen konsentrat (Tingkat bukti kurasi: B (Farmakologis)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Kurkumin memiliki aktivitas antikoagulan ringan dan menghambat aktivasi faktor pembekuan darah.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.phymed.2011.01.010</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Phytomedicine &amp; Laporan Kasus Interaksi Herbal</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT009_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT009_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Basis data kurasi sekunder; rekaman tidak memberikan insidensi atau bukti uji klinis primer.</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Increased ectopic pacemaker activity has been reported to occur in patients taking digoxin in combination with pseudoephedrine.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://ddinter2.scbdd.com/server/interact/7594/</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 - detail interaksi Digoxin dan Pseudoephedrine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT009_02 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT009_02">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Label menyebut digitalis sebagai kelompok, bukan Digoxin secara spesifik; label ini tidak menetapkan kelas keparahan dan merupakan versi arsip.</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Increased ectopic pacemaker activity can occur when pseudoephedrine is used concomitantly with digitalis.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=121362c5-3a59-42f8-b721-fa0342d99c4b</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DailyMed - Allegra-D (fexofenadine/pseudoephedrine) label</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT010_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT010_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Database interaksi terkurasi (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Efek vasokonstriksi alfa-1 adrenergik memicu peningkatan afterload dan risiko stimulasi aritmia pada jantung terdigitalisasi.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>http://ddinter.scbdd.com</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code R) — Phenylephrine &amp; Digoxin</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT011_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT011_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Duplikasi kelas antihistamin H1 generasi 1 (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Kombinasi dua antihistamin generasi-1 menimbulkan polifarmasi duplikasi reseptor H1 dan muskarinik.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://pionas.pom.go.id</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code D) &amp; Pedoman Apoteker IAI / PIONAS</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT012_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT012_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Database interaksi terkurasi (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Pemberian bersamaan antihistamin Gen-2 (Cetirizine) dan Gen-1 (CTM dalam obat flu kombinasi).</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>http://ddinter.scbdd.com</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code R) — Cetirizine &amp; Chlorpheniramine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT013_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT013_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Kombinasi lazim obat batuk dengan peringatan sedasi (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Efek depresan SSP aditif antara antitusif derivat morfinan dan antihistamin sedatif.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://pionas.pom.go.id</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code R) &amp; BPOM Informasi Obat Nasional</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT014_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT014_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Penurunan efek antihipertensi ACEI oleh NSAID (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Inhibisi prostaglandin vasodilator ginjal oleh Ibuprofen menurunkan aliran darah glomerulus dan meniadakan efek hipotensif captopril.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://pionas.pom.go.id</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code R) &amp; J. Hypertens. / PIONAS</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT015_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT015_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Antagonisme retensi natrium/cairan NSAID (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Retensi cairan dan natrium yang diinduksi NSAID mengantagonis efek dilatasi arteriol perifer amlodipine.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>http://ddinter.scbdd.com</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code R) — Amlodipine &amp; Ibuprofen</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT016_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT016_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Risiko disglikemia/hipoglikemia berat fluorokuinolon (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Fluorokuinolon menghambat kanal K-ATP sel beta pankreas dan metabolisme glimepiride via CYP2C9.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code A) &amp; ADA / FDA Warning</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT017_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT017_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Relevan bila dosis paracetamol &gt;2 g/hari berulang (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Metabolit NAPQI paracetamol dapat menghambat enzim vitamin K epoksida reduktase jika dikonsumsi dosis tinggi berulang (&gt;2 g/hari).</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>http://ddinter.scbdd.com</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code B) &amp; Chest Antithrombotic Guideline</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT018_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT018_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Batas dosis maksimal simvastatin 20 mg/hari bersama amlodipine (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Inhibisi parsial CYP3A4 oleh Amlodipine meningkatkan paparan plasma Simvastatin hingga 1.7x lipat.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code A) &amp; FDA Drug Safety Communication 2011</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT019_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT019_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Interaksi absorpsi pH-dependen minor (Tingkat bukti kurasi: B (Farmakokinetik)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Peningkatan pH lambung akibat PPI sedikit menurunkan kelarutan dan absorpsi awal ciprofloxacin.</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>http://ddinter.scbdd.com</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code A) — Omeprazole &amp; Ciprofloxacin</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT020_01 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#bukti_EV_INT020_01">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/kbr-group4/kb_v1.owl#SumberBukti"/>
        <kbr:batasBukti>Kombinasi terapeutik standar dengan pemantauan glukosa (Tingkat bukti kurasi: A (Klinis Terbukti)).</kbr:batasBukti>
        <kbr:kutipanBukti>Sinergi mekanisme: stimulasi sekresi insulin (sulfonilurea) + peningkatan sensitivitas insulin perifer (biguanid).</kbr:kutipanBukti>
        <kbr:urlSumber>https://pionas.pom.go.id</kbr:urlSumber>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">DDInter 2.0 (code A) &amp; Konsensus DM PERKENI</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


